<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT AUSTRALIA BY EIGHT WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT AUSTRALIA BY EIGHT WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa beat Australia by eight wickets on the fourth day of the third and final cricket test match at Centurion Park on Monday. Australia won the series, 2-1.</p>
<p>Result: South Africa beat Australia by eight wickets. Australia 227 and 185 (Steve Waugh 60 not out, Allan Donald 5-36), South Africa 384 and 32-2.</p>
